  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Place zucchini and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle generously with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-b2056989.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, finely chop onion and garlic. Thinly slice pear (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-3325e91d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook onion until tender, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, vegetable stock powder, a good pinch of brown sugar, the butter and a splash of water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 5-6 minutes. Stir in 1/2 the mixed leaves until just wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-6c6abcb3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sauce is simmering, combine panko breadcrumbs and grated Parmesan cheese in a medium bowl. Drizzle with olive oil. Season, then stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-4e34ced9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer roasted veggies to a baking dish. Add the tomato sauce, gently stirring to combine. Top evenly with shredded Cheddar cheese, followed by the pangrattato. Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. Meanwhile, combine pear and remaining mixed leaves in a second medium bowl.\n• Add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Season, then toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-5f4ecdea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide cheesy pumpkin, tomato and veggie bake between plates. Serve with pear salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-d884e1ee.jpg"
    }
  ]
